{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今絶賛髪の毛切りたい症候群に駆られていますどうも若月です。ロングも好きよ？\nでもね、\nショートまでは切らずとも\n肩に髪がつくかつかないか位に\n切りたいぜぃ(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\nどう思う？どう思う？(笑)\n春だしさ♪\n↑関係ない(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで今回は\nただの若月の希望で\nはじまりました若月ブログ(σ*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんいかがお過ごしですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/12/6000843/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人めで 決めてみましたが!!\nいかがですかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月は６月で18ですよぉ...\n18って聞くとなんだか\n大人になった気がする♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ同じ６月で22歳になる\n素敵な素敵な\nおばさ...お姉さまもいらっしゃいますんでね(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーまぁね、22年目の\n６月は盛大にいじっ...祝って\nやってください(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月はね、まだ\n６月で18なんで(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまぁ、乃木坂のお母さんを\nいじるのはここまでにして..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみに皆さん\nお誕生日いつですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/12/6000843/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、コメントで\n乃木坂family内で\n同じ誕生日の方がいたら\n面白いですね(σ*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばかつきぃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/12/6000843/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/12/6000843/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってかなぜ誕生日ネタ(笑)\nなんの意味もないのが\n若月クオリティ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PS:\n衛藤と深川を混ぜるな危険(笑)\n完全に天然同士で\n収集がつきません(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに\n桜井のおじぃちゃんは\nバズライトイヤーに\n似ているらしい(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと桜井にも似てる？\n↑岩瀬。"}],"source":"archive"}